Hey!

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:25.800
Hey!

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:27.800
Hey!

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:28.800
Hey!

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:34.800
Hey!

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.800
Let's hitch up here.

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:38.800
Watch out!

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:44.800
Yeah.

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:49.800
Let me do the talking.

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:51.800
We don't want to scare these folks.

00:04:54.800 --> 00:05:06.640
Someone's having fun in there.

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:09.540
You two, get yourself out of sight.

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:14.940
One lonely man is a lot less intimidating than three nasty-looking degenerates.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:18.020
Arthur, in that cattle shed on the left.

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:20.560
Micah, get down behind that wagon in front.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:42.240
Hello?

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:44.100
Shut up, Billy.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:45.780
Excuse me.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:47.640
Hello?

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:50.460
Oh, uh, hello, friend.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:51.600
What you want?

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:53.780
I am very sorry.

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:54.780
Too disturbing.

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:55.260
I don't want to disturb you.

00:05:55.880 --> 00:06:00.000
Uh, my friends and I, well, we got into some trouble up the way.

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:01.660
Lost in the storm.

00:06:03.860 --> 00:06:04.900
Ah, gentlemen.

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:06.960
We can't help you, mister.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:11.740
I got folks dying on the trail.

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:12.440
Arthur, we got a problem.

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:14.760
Folks.

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.100
There's a corpse right here.

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:21.540
Now, I just need some cans of food or something.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:22.540
I hear you.

00:06:22.680 --> 00:06:24.780
Just keep your eyes on.

00:06:24.800 --> 00:06:25.300
Please.

00:06:25.300 --> 00:06:25.940
Please.

00:06:28.600 --> 00:06:29.980
You should go now, buddy.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:35.240
Over there!

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:36.360
