00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:37.240
It's an android!

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:45.700
There's another one shooting from the window!

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:47.540
Back there, Morgan!

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:51.820
Come on, you stupid son of a bitch!

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:54.200
Goddamn bastards!

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:54.780
