00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:24.300
No way!

00:07:24.300 --> 00:07:43.480
Arthur, I said I'd handle this!

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:45.640
Didn't seem to be going too well.

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:49.080
Goddamn O'Driscoll boys here! Why?

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:51.940
I don't know. Maybe same reason as us.

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:57.940
Micah, go bring the horses closer to the house. Arthur, let's go search the cabin.

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:02.940
Smells like a party in here.

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:06.940
Turn the place upside down. Grab as many supplies as you can.

00:08:06.940 --> 00:08:12.940
We need the essentials. Food, medicine, whiskey.

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:14.940
Oh, I'm starving.

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:17.940
You should eat... something now.

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:20.940
Get your strength up for the ride back.

00:08:21.940 --> 00:08:23.940
I'll be right back.

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:33.940
O'Driscoll's. I don't believe it.

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:35.940
It's a strange one, Arthur.

00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:38.940
Hey, maybe they're hiding up here too.

00:08:38.940 --> 00:08:41.940
There's a big price on comb O'Driscoll's had.

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:44.940
Nearly as big as the one on yours.

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:49.940
Wantin' comb dead is about the only thing me and Uncle Sam agree on.

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:54.940
I've got a feeling this place is gonna be a mess.

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:56.940
We're gonna have to find a way to get out of here.

00:08:56.940 --> 00:09:00.940
This place is dry and warm. We could maybe move the women and Jack down here.

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:05.940
Maybe. We'll see how they are when we get back. I don't really want us to split up.

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:08.940
I've got a feeling this place is gonna be a mess.

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:10.940
I don't really want us to split up.

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:13.940
Maybe we should just leave.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:15.940
I'm not sure how we'll get out of here.

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:17.940
We should just go back.

00:09:17.940 --> 00:09:18.940
I'm scared.

00:09:18.940 --> 00:09:19.940
I'm scared.

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:22.940
I'm scared.

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:24.940
See if you can take the hat off by you don't stab them.

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:26.940
You just have to cause some trouble.

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:27.940
Oh, yeah.

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:30.940
Oh, I had to go find the Flannery.

00:09:30.940 --> 00:09:33.940
Now shouldn't that give him good time as a young Link?

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:35.940
Thank Oddy for when.

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:37.940
Thank Oddy for when.

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:39.940
You better, thank you.

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:40.940
You yourself.

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:42.940
Thanks, I was eyes on.

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:45.940
Why, I wish I could have gotten this out by myself for taking some time off.

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:46.940
Batch, this is Ed.

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.940
Let's hope you avoid the Fang Wins.

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:36.400
I'm gonna break your neck!

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:40.400
