00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:37.080
Do what you want with him, I don't care.

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:38.960
But bring that horse when you're done.

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:42.960
I don't know anything else.

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:43.960
Please.

00:11:43.960 --> 00:11:44.960
I'm sorry.

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:45.840
I'm sorry.

00:11:45.860 --> 00:11:53.080
